* text=auto eol=lf

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown
*.php diff=php

CHANGELOG.md export-ignore
README.md export-ignore
.github/workflows/browser-tests.yml export-ignore

# Protected prototype specification (see docs/prototype/SHA256SUMS and `php artisan comparo:verify-prototype`):
# stored and checked out byte-for-byte, never line-ending normalised.
/*.md -text diff=markdown
/*.dc.html -text diff=html
/*.js -text
/sitemap*.xml -text
/robots.txt -text
/llms.txt -text
/.thumbnail -text
/screenshots/** -text
/uploads/** -text
